{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DreamBreaker is a turn-based card-based building game with rogue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Demon Lord is awakening, and you must find the Demon Lord's hiding place and improve yourself as much as you can within a limited time, sealing it again before it fully regains its  challenge after challenge, you collect scattered memories and find the truth of this world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In each game, you can choose different companions and exploration routes to find different skills and items. Experience the ever-changing world of building through different combinations!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo contains a game experience where a team of Archer, Warrior, and Priest jointly seal demons and can be played repeatedly. Contains over 100 skills, 100 passive skills, and 30 boss battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The official version will contain over 10 heroes, forming more combinations and including more events, skills and enemies. Coming soon!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3527180?t=1742298377","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3527180?t=1742298377","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527180/331d46fbf176be69698a4b3b8b4dd6fab9125977/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742298377","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527180/331d46fbf176be69698a4b3b8b4dd6fab9125977/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742298377","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DreamBreaker is a turn-based card-based building game with rogue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Demon Lord is awakening, and you must find the Demon Lord's hiding place and improve yourself as much as you can within a limited time, sealing it again before it fully regains its  challenge after challenge, you collect scattered memories and find the truth of this world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In each game, you can choose different companions and exploration routes to find different skills and items. Experience the ever-changing world of building through different combinations!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo contains a game experience where a team of Archer, Warrior, and Priest jointly seal demons and can be played repeatedly. Contains over 100 skills, 100 passive skills, and 30 boss battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The official version will contain over 10 heroes, forming more combinations and including more events, skills and enemies. Coming soon!</p>","developers":["MOYUN"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3347610","name":"DreamBreaker"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527180/d945054aa5ff898a71ff4f9dd0c5f7d565033cd2/header.jpg?t=1742298377","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257107522,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257107522/movie480.mp4?t=1741985311","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257107522/movie_max.mp4?t=1741985311"},"name":"Trailer1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257107522/61b77994789d17589441ade23adfab0f4e193c99/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741985311","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2571075